It is to be noted that these quality filters are specific to Illumina data. In the next step, the “CollectInsertSizeMetrics” parameter of GATK provides useful metrics for validating library construction including the insert size distribution and read orientation of paired-end libraries. It produces the percentages of read pairs in three orientations (Forward Reverse, Reverse Forward, and TANDEM) as a histogram.

